  "sourceTitle": "Coconut-Peach Popsicles",
  "sourceText": "Coconut-Peach Popsicles\nBy: Sabrina Lynn Rose\nPublished: Friday, August 27, 2010 - 9:01pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup diced peaches\n cup coconut milk\n2/3 cup plain coconut yogurt\n1 tablespoon brown sugar\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Using a food processor or blender, puree the peaches, coconut milk, brown sugar and yogurt until smooth. 2 Pour the mixture into molds and freeze until set, about 4 hours.",
